{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T13:55:23.452Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-8jdc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-x17o8l","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-8jdc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T13:55:23.452Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-28T13:55:23.452Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation note (2026-11-28). Statuses: inspectRuntimeStatusDefinition(definition, fallbackOrder) returns {resolved, loss}, and both the registry (normalizeRuntimeStatusDefinition) and the validate scan read it. A non-string description is ignored. Non-string or unknown aliases and roles, and a non-finite order, are reported. A non-object entry or an empty id drops the entry. Types: the registry's extension coercion (coerceTypeDefinitionFromUnknown plus its option and policy helpers) moved to core/item/item-type-inspection.ts as inspectItemTypeDefinition(raw, policy), and schema/types.json entries now pass through it before the settings normalizer, which used to call trim on raw file values. Policy: an unknown execution_role in a schema file fails closed (reads as human, never offered for agent dispatch, reported). An extension registration with one is still refused (policy throw), as before. Validate: scanSchemaFileEntryLosses reads the configured statuses and types files and emits validate_schema_{status,type}_definition_{dropped,partial}:N with rows {source, index, id|name, dropped?, ignored?}. It shares collectDefinitionLosses and readConfiguredSchema with the field scan. Negative control: published 2026.11.27 (npm-installed in a scratch prefix) gives settings_read_merge_failed and id_prefix back to pm- for a statuses.json with description 5. This branch keeps id_prefix zz- and warns runtime_schema_{statuses,types}_entry_invalid:1 only for the unusable entries."}]}],"before_hash":"db81b59d1515d74e1a9e36d0afca69bf78b9cce19dbda5f74b7d2555d8f2b53f","after_hash":"1bd4aed415b4065a9c465257fe707318d367a2eaad70760a07766605945b43ea","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"a8ac1b2003255069602ce009db7bd930f493666a93077fba4f32bd0b9e6269be"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T13:55:24.187Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-8jdc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-x17o8l","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-x17o8l","lineage:pm-8jdc","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T13:55:24.187Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-28T13:55:24.187Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"When a value guards dispatch or authority, an unreadable stored value must not fall back to the permissive default. Ignoring an invalid execution_role leaves the type agent-dispatchable, so does dropping the whole entry (unknown types read as agent), and so does today's settings reset. Fail closed with an explicit value (human) and report it, instead of choosing between ignore and drop."}]}],"before_hash":"1bd4aed415b4065a9c465257fe707318d367a2eaad70760a07766605945b43ea","after_hash":"d48b074637d108ba3cbc114e19fd4fa97dbd3198f06dbd960a456515fe55cdf0","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"1fbd7cd964f227f911a2b8f695159f705b645b1e247d5d48ffea1fb7497bdf84"}
